  "notes": "No source media, runtime state, or release finalization was touched. The applied migration is limited to two exact reviewed 25-packet tranches (50 completed packets total); three completed packets without date_completed remain active and are reported as invalid/incomplete.\nBounded migration covers only the exact reviewed packet IDs and their derived summaries; unrelated dirty paths are excluded.\nThe second tranche targets packets with derived summaries so generated-summary reduction is material while the total migration remains bounded.\nStrict worktree coverage was rerun after the completed release wrapper; all archive change paths were covered, while the global command remained blocked by 38 unrelated concurrent audit/generated paths, which were intentionally not added to this packet.\nGenerated summary added for the completed migration packet.\nCover archived completed evidence in the browser-backed Maintenance change ledger fixture.\nRefresh the generated summary after the archived-ledger smoke update."
